<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτέρ-ως</span></b> , Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότερος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in which of two ways?</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἂν μᾶλλον ἄνθρωποι σωφρονοῖεν,
				ἀργοῦντες ἢ . . ἐπιμελόμενοι;</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.7.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.6.15
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότερόν ἐστιν
			αὐτῆς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τραγῳδίας</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> τὸ ἐπιχείρημα . . , χαρίζεσθαι . . ,
					ἢ καὶ διαμάχεσθαι; π. σοι δοκεῖ . .;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					502b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cra.</u>
				435e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. οὖν οἴει μᾶλλον ἂν
				φοβεῖσθαι . . , εἰ ὁρῷεν . . , ἢ εἰ
			καταδοξάσειαν</span> . .; <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.7.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in indirect
			questions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διορίσαι, π. λέγεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					341b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διερευνήσασθαι . . π.
			ἔχει</span> ib..<i><span class="en">
				368c
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				272d
			</span></i>.</div>
